http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0.3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>21</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mn>70</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mn>70</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>C</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>70</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, we obtain the following expression for <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"204\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml